  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AYODA Youth Empowerment Through Skill Upgrading</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Vocational training, Beneficiaries: 150 Somali youth, including 75 women, Summary: The project funds will be used to train 150 youth in various in-demand vocations in Borame, Saylac, and Lughaya towns of Somalia. The selected trainees will complete two months of training and then two months of apprenticeship, after which they will be assisted either in finding employment or in starting their own businesses.</narrative>
  </description>
